# WolkaraForever layer patch 0067 - measure full-arena reply handling
#
# Verify the exact zero encoding without allocating a decoded buffer on success.
# Time whole preflight deliveries separately from the gap between deliveries.
# Keep the negotiated packet limits, batch depth and detach rules intact.
